<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Capstar Hotel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Capstar Hotel started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Joyce Minor said she initiated coverage of CapStar Hotel Investors Inc with a buy rating and a one-year target price of $25-$26.</p>
<p>-- &quot;CapStar's owned properties are positioned in the upscale price segment of the lodging industry, which has very strong fundamentals going forward,&quot; Minor said.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 3/8 at 17-3/8.</p>
</text>
